<title>USA: York International to close Houston plant.</title>
<headline>York International to close Houston plant.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>York International Corp said on Monday it will close its Houston manufacturing plant and consolidate its chiller production at the company's York, Pa., plant.</p>
<p>About 100 jobs will be lost in Houston, while the Grantly Plant in York will gain between 70 and 100 jobs, the company said. Some Houston workers will be offered transfers to York.</p>
<p>The Houston plant will shut down April 11, the company said.</p>
<p>York makes heating, ventilating, air-conditioning and refrigeration products.</p>
